# OSC 22 sets the pointer's shape. The prefix = and no prefix both set
# it, and __current__ answers the shape that shows. An empty name resets
# the pointer to the default shape. A list falls back from name to name,
# as a CSS cursor list does, so the first name vtium knows wins.
# spec: kitty's pointer-shapes specification: the escape code's form, "Reset the pointer to default", and the __current__ query; xterm's ctlseqs, OSC Ps = 2 2; ADR-1000 window.pointer-shape
# covers: window.pointer-shape
size 10 2
send "\e]22;pointer\e\\\e]22;?__current__\e\\"
check
reply "\e]22;pointer\e\\"
send "\e]22;=text\e\\\e]22;?__current__\e\\"
check
reply "\e]22;text\e\\"
send "\e]22;=zoom-in,crosshair\e\\\e]22;?__current__\e\\"
check
reply "\e]22;crosshair\e\\"
send "\e]22;\e\\\e]22;?__current__\e\\"
check
reply "\e]22;default\e\\"
